A passive buzzer is playing on D8 and an LED is connected to D11 with a resistor. In this code, written to light the LED dimly, the LED's brightness cannot be controlled. Where is the bug?

```
void setup() {
  pinMode(11, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {
  tone(8, 440, 2000);
  analogWrite(11, 64);
  delay(2000);
}
```
